  "Purpose of Visit: [PURPOSE]nnThe purpose of this visit is for [DETAILED_PURPOSE], which will take place from [START_DATE] to [END_DATE].nn访问目的：[PURPOSE]nn此次访问旨在[DETAILED_PURPOSE]，时间为[START_DATE]至[END_DATE]。": "訪問目的：[PURPOSE]\\n\\nこの訪問は、[DETAILED_PURPOSE]を目的として、[START_DATE]から[END_DATE]まで実施されます。\\n\\n访问目的：[PURPOSE]\\n\\n此次访问旨在[DETAILED_PURPOSE]，时间为[START_DATE]至[END_DATE]。",
  "Hosting Company: [HOST_COMPANY]nRegistration No.: [REG_NUMBER]nAddress: [HOST_ADDRESS]nContact Person: [CONTACT_NAME]nPhone: [CONTACT_PHONE]nEmail: [CONTACT_EMAIL]nn我司信息如下：n公司名称：[HOST_COMPANY]n注册号：[REG_NUMBER]n地址：[HOST_ADDRESS]n联系人：[CONTACT_NAME]n电话：[CONTACT_PHONE]n邮箱：[CONTACT_EMAIL]": "招聘企業：[HOST_COMPANY]\\n登録番号：[REG_NUMBER]\\n住所：[HOST_ADDRESS]\\n連絡担当者：[CONTACT_NAME]\\n電話：[CONTACT_PHONE]\\nメール：[CONTACT_EMAIL]\\n\\n当社情報は以下の通りです：\\n会社名：[HOST_COMPANY]\\n登録番号：[REG_NUMBER]\\n住所：[HOST_ADDRESS]\\n連絡担当者：[CONTACT_NAME]\\n電話：[CONTACT_PHONE]\\nメール：[CONTACT_EMAIL]",
  "Accommodation Arrangement:n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]nnAll expenses including travel, accommodation, and local transportation will be:n[ ] borne by the hosting companyn[ ] shared between both partiesn[ ] borne by the invited partynn住宿安排：n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]nn行程、住宿及本地交通费用：n[ ] 由邀请方承担n[ ] 双方分担n[ ] 被邀请方自行承担": "宿泊手配：\\n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]\\n\\n旅費、宿泊費、および現地交通費は、以下のいずれかとなります：\\n[ ] 招聘企業が負担\\n[ ] 双方で分担\\n[ ] 招聘対象者が自己負担\\n\\n住宿安排：\\n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]\\n\\n行程、住宿及本地交通费用：\\n[ ] 由邀请方承担\\n[ ] 双方分担\\n[ ] 被邀请方自行承担",
  "We hereby guarantee that [GUEST_NAME] will comply with Chinese laws and regulations during their stay in China and will leave the country before the expiration of their authorized stay.nn我们特此担保，[GUEST_NAME]在华期间将遵守中国法律法规，并在授权停留期满前离境。": "当社は、[GUEST_NAME]が中国滞在中に中国の法律・規制を遵守し、許可された滞在期間の満了前に出国することを保証いたします。\\n\\n我们特此担保，[GUEST_NAME]在华期间将遵守中国法律法规，并在授权停留期满前离境。",
  "We look forward to welcoming [GUEST_NAME] and are happy to provide any additional information needed.nn我们期待[GUEST_NAME]的到来，并乐于提供任何所需的补充信息。nnSincerely,n[HOST_SIGNATURE]n[HOST_TITLE]n[HOST_COMPANY]nn此致n敬礼nn[HOST_SIGNATURE]n[HOST_TITLE]n[HOST_COMPANY]nnCompany Seal / 公司盖章": "[GUEST_NAME]のお越しを心待ちにしており、必要な追加情報があれば喜んで提供いたします。\\n\\n敬具\\n\\n[HOST_SIGNATURE]\\n[HOST_TITLE]\\n[HOST_COMPANY]\\n\\n此致\\n敬礼\\n\\n[HOST_SIGNATURE]\\n[HOST_TITLE]\\n[HOST_COMPANY]\\n\\n会社印 / 公司盖章",
